     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Because the powers of 10 match, use the distributive property to factor the power of 10 from the numbers. Then, add the other part of the numbers separately.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"7.57 \\times {10^{13}} + 2.031 \\times {10^{13}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {7.57 + 2.031} \\right) \\times {10^{13}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"9.601 \\times {10^{13}}\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"9.601 \\times {10^{13}}\">9.601 \\times {10^{13}}</span>"
    }
   ],
