    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Because the powers of 10 match, use the distributive property to factor the power of 10 from the numbers. Then, subtract the other part of the numbers separately.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"3.03 \\times {10^{ - 6}} - 1.5 \\times {10^{ - 6}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {3.03 - 1.5} \\right) \\times {10^{ - 6}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"1.53 \\times {10^{ - 6}}\"></span></p>"
    },
